FILES TO CREATE:
  src/main/java/com/loanfactory/lfiq/savedfilter/model/request/CreateSavedFilterRequest.java
  src/main/java/com/loanfactory/lfiq/savedfilter/model/request/UpdateSavedFilterRequest.java

REFERENCE: AbstractRequest pattern from releasenote module request classes.

CreateSavedFilterRequest extends AbstractRequest:
  @NotBlank @JsonProperty("target") String target
  @NotBlank @JsonProperty("name") String name
  @JsonProperty("filter") String filter      — nullable
  @JsonProperty("sort") String sort          — nullable
  @JsonProperty("search") String search      — nullable
  @NotBlank @JsonProperty("url") String url
  @JsonProperty("metadata") @Builder.Default Map<String,Object> metadata = new HashMap<>()
  @JsonProperty("is_default") @Builder.Default boolean isDefault = false

UpdateSavedFilterRequest extends AbstractRequest (PATCH — all nullable, only provided fields applied):
  @JsonProperty("name") String name          — nullable
  @JsonProperty("filter") String filter      — nullable
  @JsonProperty("sort") String sort          — nullable
  @JsonProperty("search") String search      — nullable
  @JsonProperty("url") String url            — nullable
  @JsonProperty("metadata") Map<String,Object> metadata — nullable; when present replaces the whole map
  @JsonProperty("is_default") Boolean isDefault — nullable Boolean (not primitive); when true=set default, false=clear, null=no change
  NOTE: target and user_id are NOT present in UpdateSavedFilterRequest (not updatable)

All fields use @JsonProperty with snake_case names.

ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA:
- ./gradlew compileJava passes
- @JsonProperty snake_case names match entity columns
- @Valid on CreateSavedFilterRequest rejects blank target/name/url

