## Mục tiêu
Tạo pure-function utilities và unit tests. File này được import bởi cả AuditTab.tsx và AuditLogDetailModalV2. KHÔNG có React dependency — pure TypeScript.

## Files cần tạo (MỚI)
- `lf-iq/src/shared/components/AuditLogDetailModalV2/utils.ts`
- `lf-iq/src/shared/components/AuditLogDetailModalV2/utils.test.ts`

## Implementation utils.ts (verbatim từ design.md Decision 1 + 3)

```ts
export type ActorKind = 'email' | 'self' | 'uuid' | 'empty' | 'other'

const MARKDOWN_EMAIL_RE = /^\[([^\]]+)\]\(mailto:[^)]+\)$/
const UUID_RE = /^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i

function stripMarkdownEmail(raw: string): string {
  const m = raw.match(MARKDOWN_EMAIL_RE)
  return m ? m[1] : raw
}

export function formatActor(raw: string | null | undefined): { label: string; kind: ActorKind } {
  if (!raw) return { label: '', kind: 'empty' }
  const trimmed = raw.trim()
  if (!trimmed) return { label: '', kind: 'empty' }
  const stripped = stripMarkdownEmail(trimmed)
  if (stripped.toLowerCase() === 'you') return { label: 'You', kind: 'self' }
  if (stripped.includes('@')) return { label: stripped, kind: 'email' }
  if (UUID_RE.test(stripped)) return { label: stripped, kind: 'uuid' }
  return { label: stripped, kind: 'other' }
}

export type ParsedAuditValue =
  | { kind: 'empty' }
  | { kind: 'json'; pretty: string; raw: string }
  | { kind: 'text'; display: string }

export function parseAuditValue(raw: string | null | undefined): ParsedAuditValue {
  if (raw === null || raw === undefined) return { kind: 'empty' }
  if (typeof raw !== 'string' || raw.length === 0) return { kind: 'empty' }
  const stripped = stripMarkdownEmail(raw.trim())
  if (!stripped) return { kind: 'empty' }
  try {
    const parsed = JSON.parse(stripped)
    if (parsed !== null && typeof parsed === 'object') {
      return { kind: 'json', pretty: JSON.stringify(parsed, null, 2), raw: stripped }
    }
    return { kind: 'text', display: String(parsed) }
  } catch {
    return { kind: 'text', display: stripped }
  }
}

export function isJsonString(raw: string | null | undefined): boolean {
  return parseAuditValue(raw).kind === 'json'
}

export function isOversizedJson(pretty: string): boolean {
  if (!pretty) return false
  return pretty.length > 800 || pretty.split('\n').length > 16
}
```

QUAN TRỌNG: isJsonString của utils.ts này KHÁC với @shared/utils/common — version này trả false cho quoted scalars ('ACTIVE', 'true'), trong khi version cũ trả true. Không sửa cái cũ (V1 modal vẫn dùng nó).

## Unit tests bắt buộc (utils.test.ts)

Dùng Jest, KHÔNG có React. Tests cần cover:

### formatActor:
- formatActor(null) → { label: '', kind: 'empty' }
- formatActor(undefined) → { label: '', kind: 'empty' }
- formatActor('') → { label: '', kind: 'empty' }
- formatActor('   ') → { label: '', kind: 'empty' }
- formatActor('you') → { label: 'You', kind: 'self' }
- formatActor('YOU') → { label: 'You', kind: 'self' }
- formatActor('super.admin@loanfactory.com') → { label: 'super.admin@loanfactory.com', kind: 'email' }
- formatActor('[super.admin@loanfactory.com](mailto:super.admin@loanfactory.com)') → { label: 'super.admin@loanfactory.com', kind: 'email' }
- formatActor('c1cc6e9f-4ddf-4cfa-bb2a-b3c6b8561eff') → { label: 'c1cc6e9f-4ddf-4cfa-bb2a-b3c6b8561eff', kind: 'uuid' }
- formatActor('C1CC6E9F-4DDF-4CFA-BB2A-B3C6B8561EFF') → { ..., kind: 'uuid' }
- formatActor('arbitrary-string') → { label: 'arbitrary-string', kind: 'other' }

### parseAuditValue:
- parseAuditValue(null) → { kind: 'empty' }
- parseAuditValue('') → { kind: 'empty' }
- parseAuditValue('   ') → { kind: 'empty' }
- parseAuditValue('plain text') → { kind: 'text', display: 'plain text' }
- parseAuditValue('"ACTIVE"') → { kind: 'text', display: 'ACTIVE' } (quoted scalar unwrapped)
- parseAuditValue('true') → { kind: 'text', display: 'true' }
- parseAuditValue('42') → { kind: 'text', display: '42' }
- parseAuditValue('[1,2,3]') → { kind: 'json', pretty: '[\n  1,\n  2,\n  3\n]', raw: '[1,2,3]' }
- parseAuditValue('{"a":1}') → { kind: 'json', pretty: '{\n  "a": 1\n}', raw: '{"a":1}' }
- parseAuditValue('[t@y.com](mailto:t@y.com)') → { kind: 'text', display: 't@y.com' }
- parseAuditValue('not-json {') → { kind: 'text', display: 'not-json {' }

### isJsonString:
- isJsonString('{"a":1}') → true
- isJsonString('"ACTIVE"') → false (KHÁC với @shared/utils/common version!)
- isJsonString('true') → false
- isJsonString(null) → false

### isOversizedJson:
- isOversizedJson('') → false
- isOversizedJson('a') → false
- isOversizedJson('a'.repeat(801)) → true
- isOversizedJson(Array(17).fill('x').join('\n')) → true (17 lines > 16)
- isOversizedJson(Array(15).fill('x').join('\n')) → false (15 lines ≤ 16)

## Acceptance Criteria
- 4 exports đủ và typed đúng
- npx jest src/shared/components/AuditLogDetailModalV2/utils.test.ts exits 0
- Tất cả test cases pass
- npx tsc --noEmit passes
- File utils.ts < 200 lines

